versary of the terrorist attacks of September 11, 2001, about where the nation is still vulnerable introduced; details given about problems with port security & the development of a better cargo tracking system; scenes shown from ports.  [Council on Foreign Relations \"America the Vulnerable\" author Stephen FLYNN&#134;- outlines what is not known about the shipping containers moving into our ports; notes shutting down the ports would shut down our global trade system; comments on the technology {monitoring systems} that could be used to inspect containers.]   (Studio: Peter Jennings)  The introduction of Senate legislation to implement all of the proposals from the committee investigating September 11 noted.", "segment_duration": 230, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64140.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764729, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "gaKHtTlX65", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-07", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764720, "segment_id": "X0rgc6uEcT", "segment_broadcast_id": "gaKHtTlX65", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Peter Jennings)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64370.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764730, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "gaKHtTlX65", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-07", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadc